{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25247","headline":"望京楼上寄令狐华州 · 李逢吉","name":"望京楼上寄令狐华州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"祗役滞南服，颓思属暮年。\n闲上望京台，万山蔽其前。\n落日归飞翼，连翩东北天。\n涪江适在下，爲我久潺湲。\n中叶成文教，德威清远边。\n颁条信徒尔，华发生苍然。\n寄怀三峰守，岐路隔云烟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李逢吉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25247.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25247","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}